{"3470140": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "METAMORPHOSIS", "steam_appid": 3470140, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Explore the ruins of a dead world as Aria</strong>, a forsaken nun seeking absolution for her sins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470140/extras/f31b5ab0163132e138d651406b672ef4.poster.avif?t=1782618817\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470140/extras/f31b5ab0163132e138d651406b672ef4.webm?t=1782618817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470140/extras/f31b5ab0163132e138d651406b672ef4.mp4?t=1782618817\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>METAMORPHOSIS</strong> is set in a <strong>future</strong> where <strong>humanity</strong> has manufactured its <strong>own rapture</strong>.<br>The <strong>surface</strong> of the Earth has long since <strong>collapsed</strong> due to <strong>war and decay</strong>, leaving nothing but silence below.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story begins as <strong>Aria descends</strong> into the depths; <strong>driven</strong> by guilt, by faith, and by <strong>something she cannot escape</strong>. The <strong>harsh, decaying world</strong> is <strong>full of atrocities and violence</strong>, and amidst the <strong>ruins</strong> and <strong>brutal encounters</strong> - <strong>could the answer to salvation really still be here?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470140/extras/8689827fcf566c6721b013384a4ba195.poster.avif?t=1782618817\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470140/extras/8689827fcf566c6721b013384a4ba195.webm?t=1782618817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470140/extras/8689827fcf566c6721b013384a4ba195.mp4?t=1782618817\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face off</strong> against a variety of <strong>foes</strong>, decrepit automatons, and <strong>pitiful mockeries</strong> of “rebirth” in <strong>deliberate, high-risk combat</strong>. Solve challenging puzzles, manage dwindling resources, and fight the remnants of an endless war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470140/extras/79f612515aed21608ba1cdecffdcc94f.poster.avif?t=1782618817\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470140/extras/79f612515aed21608ba1cdecffdcc94f.webm?t=1782618817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470140/extras/79f612515aed21608ba1cdecffdcc94f.mp4?t=1782618817\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong> large, interconnected areas filled with vertical spaces, hidden paths, and shortcuts. Wield <strong>firearms</strong> and powerful <strong>miracles</strong> to survive what lurks within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470140/extras/6a7e37c109646a5bec912c38695c25fa.poster.avif?t=1782618817\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470140/extras/6a7e37c109646a5bec912c38695c25fa.webm?t=1782618817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470140/extras/6a7e37c109646a5bec912c38695c25fa.mp4?t=1782618817\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with <strong>divine</strong> systems left behind.<strong> Confess</strong> yours sins <strong>but be careful who may be listening.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470140/extras/42a9b075aacf52634146d16fc456cb1b.poster.avif?t=1782618817\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470140/extras/42a9b075aacf52634146d16fc456cb1b.webm?t=1782618817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470140/extras/42a9b075aacf52634146d16fc456cb1b.mp4?t=1782618817\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speak with demons</strong> born both natural, and man-made. The follies you entertain, and the answers you <strong>take to heart</strong> may affect more than you think.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470140/extras/a83c88c86584c48f670f0df4c72eda6c.poster.avif?t=1782618817\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470140/extras/a83c88c86584c48f670f0df4c72eda6c.webm?t=1782618817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470140/extras/a83c88c86584c48f670f0df4c72eda6c.mp4?t=1782618817\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Find meaning in a broken world.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">-----</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>You held your hands in <strong>prayer</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Hiding inside your own <strong>faith</strong>.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>You <strong>wished</strong> for only one thing:</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>To never see her again.</strong></i></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Explore the ruins of a dead world as Aria</strong>, a forsaken nun seeking absolution for her sins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470140/extras/f31b5ab0163132e138d651406b672ef4.poster.avif?t=1782618817\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470140/extras/f31b5ab0163132e138d651406b672ef4.webm?t=1782618817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470140/extras/f31b5ab0163132e138d651406b672ef4.mp4?t=1782618817\" type=\"video/mp4\"></vi